{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Soft.</b> As its plain meaning. And some ask why this was so, for they thought that the thoughts of the Name are like their thoughts, and all created beings ought to be equal in their form. And Ben Ephraim said that it is missing alef, and its meaning is long, and it was indeed missing alef," "Beautiful of form, like \"the border's outline\" (Joshua 15:9). Each limb according to its kind, and the nose and mouth beautiful" "and the appearance of all beautiful, or the appearance of the eye of the face that is seen:"], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:46:17.752980036Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}